{"id":"ec427db58f9f0869","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-functionalinequality.md","title":"Functional inequalities as equations","display":"thm-functionalinequality — Functional inequalities as equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-functionalinequality","aliases":["27-thm-functionalinequality"],"display":"thm-functionalinequality — Functional inequalities as equations","depends_on":["[[27-df-functionalequation]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.2 Theorem 11.2","source_printed_pages":"490–491","source_pdf_pages":"514–515","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-functionalinequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-functionalinequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-functionalinequality — Functional inequalities as equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.2 Theorem 11.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"490–491"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"514–515"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{e,n}\">\\(L_{e,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{e,n}\">\\(R_{e,n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(e)\">\\(\\nu(e)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a>。对布尔标量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee b=\\max(a,b)\">\\(a\\vee b=\\max(a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=\\min(a,b)\">\\(a\\wedge b=\\min(a,b)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\leq R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\wedge R_{e,n}(f,Y)=L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\leq R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\wedge R_{e,n}(f,Y)=L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.2，印刷 pp.490–491／PDF pp.514–515；已核对陈述与证明。对 (a,b)∈{0,1}² 枚举四种值，只有 (1,0) 使三个条件同时为假。对每个向量赋值应用该等价，再取全称。</p>\n<p>两侧 FEVal 的输出确为布尔值。将两侧调用列表连接、对外层表达式重新编号，再用语法的 ∨ 或 ∧ 构造，得到 FEq 中的等式对象；因此这不只是实数不等式的一种视觉改写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-functionalequation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$L_{e,n}$、$R_{e,n}$ 与 $\\nu(e)$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]。对布尔标量 $a,b$，$a\\vee b=\\max(a,b)$、$a\\wedge b=\\min(a,b)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"L_{e,n}","display":false},{"tex":"R_{e,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(e)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a\\vee b=\\max(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\wedge b=\\min(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\leq R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\left(\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\vee R_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\wedge R_{e,n}(f,Y)=L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1923,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-functionalinequality|thm-functionalinequality — Functional inequalities as equations]]"}],"outgoing":["599d9af24f7e091a"]}